WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:03.241
Roxy flew over Metro City.

2
00:00:03.242 --> 00:00:07.129
The roads below were filled with stopped cars.

3
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.865
Roxy spotted a man sitting on a sidewalk.

4
00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:11.489
It was Detective Smith.

5
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.750
He was sweating and out of breath.

6
00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:16.618
Roxy flew down to him.

7
00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:19.435
"Hey, Detective," Roxy said.

8
00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:22.554
"You really should exercise more often."

9
00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.733
"Ha—" He stopped to take a deep breath.

10
00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:29.601
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl. I'm exhausted.

11
00:00:29.602 --> 00:00:33.171
I had to walk all the way downtown."

12
00:00:33.172 --> 00:00:35.250
"You too?" Roxy said.

13
00:00:35.251 --> 00:00:37.850
"What's happening to all the cars?"

14
00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:41.070
Detective Smith shrugged. "I spoke to some drivers.

15
00:00:41.071 --> 00:00:44.978
Everyone told me the same story. They were driving.

16
00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:47.820
Then their cars just stopped."

17
00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:52.030
Roxy shrugged. "I guess it will make the air cleaner."

18
00:00:52.031 --> 00:00:57.257
"This is serious, Rocket Girl. What if some criminals did this on purpose?

19
00:00:57.258 --> 00:00:59.748
They could be robbing banks or—"

20
00:00:59.749 --> 00:01:02.749
"Rocket Girl, help!" a man cried.

21
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.805
"My car stopped on the train tracks.

22
00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:06.957
A train is about to hit it!"

23
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:11.828
Roxy looked over and saw an electric train speeding toward the car.

24
00:01:11.829 --> 00:01:14.150
She shot over and lifted it up.

25
00:01:14.151 --> 00:01:16.549
The train whizzed by a second later.

26
00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:22.060
Roxy set the car down and wiped her forehead. "Phew!"

27
00:01:22.061 --> 00:01:25.254
Then she went back to Detective Smith.

28
00:01:25.255 --> 00:01:28.048
"Rocket Girl!" A man ran over.

29
00:01:28.049 --> 00:01:31.356
"I need to get to work. Can you fly me there?"

30
00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:35.437
"No, help me, Rocket Girl," a woman said.

31
00:01:35.438 --> 00:01:38.341
"I'm supposed to go on vacation today.

32
00:01:38.342 --> 00:01:41.375
I'm going to miss my flight!"

33
00:01:41.376 --> 00:01:45.509
"Sorry," Roxy said. "I'm not a taxi service.

34
00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:51.374
But don't worry. I'll find out what's going on—I promise!"

35
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.947
Just then a car pulled up.

36
00:01:53.948 --> 00:01:57.257
"Why is that car working?" Roxy thought.

37
00:01:57.258 --> 00:01:59.730
The driver rolled down his window.

38
00:01:59.731 --> 00:02:01.817
It was Mr. Wig.

39
00:02:01.818 --> 00:02:04.816
"What's going on here?" Mr. Wig said.

40
00:02:04.817 --> 00:02:07.923
"Why are all these cars stopped?"

41
00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:11.347
"Your car is working!" Roxy said.

42
00:02:11.348 --> 00:02:14.994
Mr. Wig frowned. "Of course it's working.

43
00:02:14.995 --> 00:02:17.720
I paid a lot of money for this electric car.

44
00:02:17.721 --> 00:02:21.462
But electric cars are better for the environment."

45
00:02:21.463 --> 00:02:23.801
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

46
00:02:23.802 --> 00:02:26.800
"Electric vehicles seem to be working."

47
00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:29.907
"Hey, Detective Smith," Mr. Wig said.

48
00:02:29.908 --> 00:02:32.501
"You're just sitting around doing nothing again.

49
00:02:32.502 --> 00:02:35.972
Maybe you should check out Dr. McGreen's farm."

50
00:02:35.973 --> 00:02:38.653
"Why?" Roxy asked.

51
00:02:38.654 --> 00:02:42.485
"There was an explosion there," Mr. Wig said.

52
00:02:42.486 --> 00:02:47.277
"And I heard a strange humming noise as I drove by."

53
00:02:47.278 --> 00:02:50.412
Roxy used her super hearing to listen for the noise.

54
00:02:50.413 --> 00:02:54.123
She heard the strange humming too.

55
00:02:54.124 --> 00:02:57.650
"See you later, Detective Smith!" Roxy said.

56
00:02:57.651 --> 00:03:03.501
She flew toward Dr. McGreen's barn.

